# serve.py regenerates .html from .md siblings on demand.
# The three exceptions below are hand-authored entry points / orphans.
*.html
!/INDEX.html
!/architecture/architecture-review.html
!/design/period-colours-preview.html

# Research-dive visual caches. Third-party images (portraits, photographs)
# fetched for local viewing — PD or not — live here and are NOT committed, so
# the public repo never redistributes rights-reserved material. Provenance and
# licence for each file are recorded in the dive's dossier.yaml; the publication
# gate lives at website/src/ (the actually-published surface), not at download.
# Facsimiles we render ourselves from local PSS PDFs (PD: Tolstoy's own text)
# go in <slug>/extracts/ instead, which IS committed.
research/*/visuals/
